            <ArticleTitle>[Severe hypercapnia in asthmatic attack].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>879-80, 943</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This is an unusual case, of an adult man who was hospitalized with a severe asthmatic attack and severe hypercapnia, refractory to intensive medical treatment, which responded to pressure mechanical ventilation. We advise to consider this mode of treatment in similar cases.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
